Agent Browser adaptation, adds MCP/policy/runtime changes, and excludes the
removed guest provider, surface and panel. Its bundled runtime dependency is
ws, MIT licensed; see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES. No OpenChamber SDK is bundled.

